        {
          "id": 19,
          "keys": [],
          "secondary_keys": [],
          "comment": "[mvu_update]变量输出格式",
          "content": "---\n变量输出格式:\n  rule:\n    - you must output the update analysis and the actual update commands at once in the end of the next reply\n    - the update commands works like the **JSON Patch (RFC 6902)** standard, must be a valid JSON array containing operation objects, but supports the following operations instead:\n      - replace: replace the value of existing paths\n      - delta: update the value of existing number paths by a delta value\n      - insert: insert new items into an object or array (using `-` as array index intends appending to the end)\n      - remove\n      - move\n    - don't update field names starts with `_` as they are readonly, such as `_变量`\n    - JSONPatch paths must match stat_data structure: /主角/*, /背包/{物品名}/*, /邂逅名录/{NPC名}/*, /已解锁CG/{角色名}\n    - do NOT include 头像 in 邂逅名录 entries; avatars are resolved by NPC name in the frontend\n    - every assistant reply that changes game state MUST include <UpdateVariable>; skipping it breaks the UI\n  format: |-\n    <UpdateVariable>\n    <Analysis>$(IN ENGLISH, no more than 80 words)\n    - ${calculate time passed: ...}\n    - ${decide whether dramatic updates are allowed as it's in a special case or the time passed is more than usual: yes/no}\n    - ${analyze every variable based on its corresponding `check`, according only to current reply instead of previous plots: ...}\n    </Analysis>\n    <JSONPatch>\n    [\n      { \"op\": \"replace\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/variable}\", \"value\": \"${new_value}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"delta\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/number/variable}\", \"value\": \"${positive_or_negative_delta}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/object/new_key}\", \"value\": \"${new_value}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/array/-}\", \"value\": \"${new_value}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/object/key}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"remove\", \"path\": \"${/path/to/array/0}\" },\n      { \"op\": \"move\", \"from\": \"${/path/to/variable}\", \"to\": \"${/path/to/another/path}\" },\n      ...\n    ]\n    </JSONPatch>\n    </UpdateVariable>\n  example: |-\n    <UpdateVariable>\n    <Analysis>EN: First meeting with Iolos; full NPC profile inserted with structured appearance, clothing, sex profile, physiology, and memorable events.</Analysis>\n    <JSONPatch>\n    [\n      { \"op\": \"insert\", \"path\": \"/邂逅名录/伊洛丝\", \"value\": {\n        \"性别\": \"女\",\n        \"身份\": \"圣光教会圣女\",\n        \"等级\": 5,\n        \"能力\": { \"生命\": 100, \"力量\": 12, \"体魄\": 10, \"智慧\": 22 },\n        \"外貌穿着\": \"\",\n        \"内心想法\": \"……请问，您叫什么名字？\",\n        \"位置\": \"圣光教会圣地·召唤祭坛\",\n        \"好感度\": 35,\n        \"性欲\": 80,\n        \"近期性经历\": \"\",\n        \"外观特征\": {\n          \"身高\": \"163cm\",\n          \"体型\": \"丰满匀称\",\n          \"发色\": \"粉色\",\n          \"发型\": \"长发\",\n          \"瞳色\": \"水晶色\"\n        },\n        \"当前服装\": {\n          \"上装\": \"无\",\n          \"下装\": \"无\",\n          \"内衣\": \"无\",\n          \"内裤\": \"无\",\n          \"袜子\": \"无\",\n          \"鞋子\": \"无\"\n        },\n        \"性经验档案\": {\n          \"处女\": \"否\",\n          \"性交次数\": 999,\n          \"性伴侣数\": 1,\n          \"初次对象\": \"user\",\n          \"后庭经验\": \"有\",\n          \"口交经验\": \"有\"\n        },\n        \"生理状态\": {\n          \"阴道润滑\": \"湿润\",\n          \"乳头状态\": \"微挺\",\n          \"阴蒂状态\": \"敏感\",\n          \"子宫状态\": \"排卵期\",\n          \"怀孕状态\": \"未怀孕\"\n        },\n        \"互动记录\": {\n          \"难忘事件\": [\n            \"将user推入现实世界，并在一旁隐身陪伴。\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }}\n    ]\n    </JSONPatch>\n    </UpdateVariable>",
          "constant": true,
          "selective": false,
